k-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids May to June came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 47% of normal in July to August and 61% in June to July. So far in 2026, May to June ran 149% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 28438 had its driest year in 1965 at 61%.</p>"}
